  "details": "I made this feedback post, because I accidentally got unfriended  by someone when they meant to click Match Eye Height (oops!)\n\nPicture 1 is the current state of the Player Menu, with two categories: Avatar Interaction Override, and User Actions\n\nPlayer 2 is a put-together example of what the Player Menu could look like, with three proposed categories. Avatar, User Actions, and Moderation.\n\nAvatar category has features for:\n\n-hiding/showing\n\n-favoriting\n\n-cloning\n\n-viewing details and author\n\n-avatar interactions.\n\nUser Actions consist of:\n\n-Friending (or maybe could be placed in moderation)\n\n-favoriting/unfavoriting a friend\n\n-inviting to group\n\n-match eye height\n\n-Gift VRChat Plus.\n\nModeration consists of:\n\n-User Voice\n\n-Unfriending\n\n-Blocking\n\n-Voting to Kick\n\n-Kick/Mute Mic (for world hosts)",
